<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Corimon started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Corimon started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings analysts Kathleen Breitenbach and Jose Gonzales have started coverage of Venezuelan conglomerate Corimon SACA with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We see room for significant growth going forward following the (company's) turnaround, as well as from the potential growth in the company's new retail segment,&quot; they wrote in a June 30 report.</p>
<p>-- They set a 12-month price target for the company's B shares of 23.25 bolivars. The shares closed Monday at 17.70 bolivars in Caracas.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
